Use Skia's WebGL interface over WebGL2.

Skia recognizes WebGL's version string and builds its WebGL interface, which
validates against the toolchain's WebGL2 entry points. Rewriting the strings to
look like GLES produced an interface Skia rejected; that rewriting is gone.

